# 🌐 Navigant Professional Portfolio Interface

This repository module contains the clean, independent frontend engineering stack designed to communicate my professional positioning, framework capabilities, and live project narratives.

## 🛠️ Architecture & Core Components
The workspace is purposefully separated from backend data storage repositories to prevent deployment collisions or branch contamination on GitHub.

*   **`index.html`**: The main entry terminal. Implements standard HTML5 semantic elements (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`) to enforce accessibility benchmarks.
*   **`story.html`**: An interactive "Build-in-Public" production log detailing my engineering iterations, system breakthroughs, and error handling logs.
*   **`styles.css`**: A centralized CSS3 stylesheet engine using global `:root` variable design tokens (e.g., `-bg-dark`, accent parameters) for cohesive color management and responsive view scaling across platforms.

## 🚀 Live Deployment
The frontend assets are linked to automated hosting workflows:
*   **Production Deployment:** Managed via Netlify with active secure SSL/HTTPS encryption.
*   **Live Application Entry:** [View My Live Portfolio Workspace](https://munazza-bukhari-ai.netlify.app)
*   **Interactive Build Log:** [Read the Live Engineering Story](https://syeda-munazza-bukhari-portfolio.netlify.app/story)
